### Use generated developer users to obtain tokens via requests/auth.http.
@taskBase = http://localhost:8082
@kpiBase = http://localhost:8083
@taskToken = replace-with-your-task-audience-token
@kpiToken = replace-with-your-kpi-audience-token
@taskId = replace-with-task-uuid
@teamId = replace-with-team-uuid
@projectId = replace-with-project-uuid
@employeeId = replace-with-user-uuid
@commandKey = {{$uuid}}

### Create (Admin/PM)
POST {{taskBase}}/api/v1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{taskToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-ID: {{$uuid}}

{"title":"Release review","description":"Review acceptance results","priority":"HIGH","teamId":"{{teamId}}","projectId":"{{projectId}}"}

### Approve (Team Leader/Admin): resend unchanged with the same key to replay.
POST {{taskBase}}/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{taskToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{commandKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":0}

### Assign (use a new stable key for this command)
POST {{taskBase}}/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{taskToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":1,"employeeId":"{{employeeId}}"}

### Start as the assigned employee
PATCH {{taskBase}}/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{taskToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":2,"status":"IN_PROGRESS"}

### Complete as the assigned employee
PATCH {{taskBase}}/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{taskToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":3,"status":"COMPLETED"}

### Close (PM/Admin)
POST {{taskBase}}/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{taskToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":4}

### Scoped history
GET {{taskBase}}/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}/history?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{taskToken}}

### My KPI, after a successful scheduled refresh
GET {{kpiBase}}/api/v1/kpis/me
Authorization: Bearer {{kpiToken}}

### Authorized team ranking
GET {{kpiBase}}/api/v1/kpis/ranking?teamId={{teamId}}&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{kpiToken}}

### My monthly trends
GET {{kpiBase}}/api/v1/kpis/trends?scope=me
Authorization: Bearer {{kpiToken}}
